{"seq":1,"slug":"price-crawl-monitoring-system","title":"全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-monitoring-enforcement/price-crawl-monitoring-system","wordCount":2793,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构\">全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一套 MAP 监测系统的本质，是让「某卖家在某时刻以某价格公开宣传某件商品」变成一条带时间戳、可举证、可回溯的记录。它和通用比价爬虫最大的区别在于<strong>归属</strong>与<strong>举证</strong>：比价只要知道「这个商品多少钱」，MAP 监测必须知道「<strong>谁</strong>在卖、<strong>是否</strong>授权、偏离了多少、证据能不能拿到谈判桌上」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[目标宇宙&lt;br/&gt;Maker/MPN/GTIN] --&gt; B[采集层&lt;br/&gt;API + 抓取 + 供应商]&#10;    B --&gt; C[解析层&lt;br/&gt;JSON-LD / API / DOM]&#10;    C --&gt; D[归一化与匹配&lt;br/&gt;身份 + 卖家归属]&#10;    D --&gt; E[价格时序库&lt;br/&gt;timeseries + 证据快照]&#10;    E --&gt; F[违规判定引擎&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 去抖]&#10;    F --&gt; G[告警 / 执行&lt;br/&gt;通知→平台举报→法务]&#10;    G --&gt; H[验证闭环&lt;br/&gt;复采确认恢复]&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    A --&gt; I[目标发现&lt;br/&gt;listing 反查]&#10;    I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[目标宇宙&lt;br/&gt;Maker/MPN/GTIN] --&gt; B[采集层&lt;br/&gt;API + 抓取 + 供应商]\n    B --&gt; C[解析层&lt;br/&gt;JSON-LD / API / DOM]\n    C --&gt; D[归一化与匹配&lt;br/&gt;身份 + 卖家归属]\n    D --&gt; E[价格时序库&lt;br/&gt;timeseries + 证据快照]\n    E --&gt; F[违规判定引擎&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 去抖]\n    F --&gt; G[告警 / 执行&lt;br/&gt;通知→平台举报→法务]\n    G --&gt; H[验证闭环&lt;br/&gt;复采确认恢复]\n    H --&gt; D\n    A --&gt; I[目标发现&lt;br/&gt;listing 反查]\n    I --&gt; B</pre><p>在选择技术路径之前，先分清三类数据来源的能力边界——它们决定了你后续能做多深的判定，而不只是快多少：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>官方 API（SP-API / Walmart / eBay）</th>\n<th>自建抓取（HTML + 代理池）</th>\n<th>第三方数据供应商</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>仅本店或授权店铺</td>\n<td>任意公开页面，含长尾</td>\n<td>已接入站点，长尾薄弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段质量</td>\n<td>结构化、稳定、含卖家维度</td>\n<td>需自解析，改版即失效</td>\n<td>已归一化，口径不可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>准实时到日级，受配额限制</td>\n<td>可高频，受反爬与成本约束</td>\n<td>通常日级快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家归属</td>\n<td>部分接口可给出卖家 ID</td>\n<td>需自行识别授权/灰产</td>\n<td>一般只给最低价，不给卖家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>举证能力</td>\n<td>官方返回值即证据</td>\n<td>需自留 HTML/截图快照</td>\n<td>依赖供应商，不便质证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规成本</td>\n<td>低（走 ToS 授权）</td>\n<td>高（需评估 ToS、robots）</td>\n<td>低（供应商承担）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成熟品牌很少三选一，而是<strong>分层混合</strong>：官方 API 做授权店铺基线，自建抓取覆盖长尾与灰产，供应商数据宽面扫描后定向复采。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集层-从目标宇宙到分布式抓取\">采集层：从目标宇宙到分布式抓取</h2><p>采集层从**目标宇宙（target universe）**开始——一份「这件产品的合法/需监控 listing 应该长什么样」的清单。品牌方从自有目录导出 MPN、GTIN/UPC/EAN、型号，再通过平台搜索、类目接口、图片反查把 GTIN 映射到具体 listing URL。这一步常被低估：目标宇宙漏掉一个灰产 listing，后面的判定再精确也无从发现它。其产出是一张 <code>( marketplace, listing_id, url, gtin, seller_hint )</code> 表，作为滚动基线。</p>\n<p>抓取的<strong>调度</strong>不该均匀。频率应由风险评分驱动，把有限预算压到最可能出现违规的坐标上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>priority</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>histViolations</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>volatility</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>trafficRank</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>newListing</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{priority}\\_i = w_1 \\cdot \\text{histViolations}\\_i + w_2 \\cdot \\text{volatility}\\_i + w_3 \\cdot \\text{trafficRank}\\_i + w_4 \\cdot \\text{newListing}\\_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">priority</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">histViolations</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">volatility</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trafficRank</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">newListing</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>newListing</code> 项给新出现的卖家加权——没有历史、没有授权的 listing 一旦出现，往往正是窜货的前兆。调度的本质是一个受约束的排序问题：按 <code>priority</code> 降序取到预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{cost}_i \\le B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为止。</p>\n<p><strong>合规边界要在写代码之前定死。</strong> robots.txt 由 RFC 9309 定义，解析器至少要能处理 500 KiB 的内容；<code>Crawl-delay</code> <strong>不属于</strong> RFC 9309，其解释完全取决于爬虫（Yandex 按秒理解，Bing 视为 1–30 秒的访问窗口，Google 直接忽略）。因此「遵守 crawl-delay」在跨站点时是不一致的承诺——更稳的做法是自设全局速率与并发上限。2025 年出现两类新信号：Cloudflare 的 <code>Content-Signal</code>（如 <code>ai-train=no, search=yes</code>）与 RSL Collective 的 Really Simple Licensing，后者让发布方在 robots.txt 声明授权条款，参与方含 Medium、Reddit、Yahoo（来源：robots.txt 标准公开资料与 RSL Collective 公告）。监测系统应把这些信号纳入请求前置判断——发布方的授权声明变化可能直接改变某站点的可抓取性。</p>\n<p>分布式实现上，典型构件是：URL 队列 + 无状态 worker 池 + 混合代理池 + 按域令牌桶限速 + 内容指纹去重。worker 必须<strong>幂等</strong>：重复投递不能产生两条重复价格记录，去重键可用 <code>(listing_id, observed_at 分钟粒度)</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解析层-从页面到规范化价格记录\">解析层：从页面到规范化价格记录</h2><p>解析的第一优先级永远是<strong>结构化数据</strong>，而非 DOM。商品详情页普遍以 JSON-LD 内嵌 schema.org 的 <code>Product</code> / <code>Offer</code>，其中 <code>price</code>（数字或文本，小数点用 <code>.</code>）、<code>priceCurrency</code>（ISO 4217 代码）、<code>priceValidUntil</code>、<code>priceSpecification</code> 和 <code>availability</code> 是最关键的五个字段；同页有多个卖家时用 <code>AggregateOffer</code>，它给出 <code>lowPrice</code>、<code>highPrice</code>、<code>offerCount</code>（来源：schema.org Offer 与 AggregateOffer 词条）。结构化数据缺失或失真时才降级到平台 API，最后才是 CSS 选择器 + 兜底正则；三级降级共用同一份抽取契约，否则下游口径会漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>最大的技术债在这里：价格字段的语义歧义。</strong> 同一页面可能同时存在划线价（list price）、现价（sale price）、购物车价、会员价、优惠券后价。MAP 政策通常约束 <strong>advertised price</strong>（公开宣传价），但渠道治理真正关心的是<strong>到手价</strong>——一个卖家标价合规、结账叠券后击穿地板的情况，最难举证也最伤价格。因此解析契约应显式区分字段并各自记录来源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;listing_id&quot;: &quot;B0XXXXXXXX&quot;,&#10;  &quot;gtin&quot;: &quot;0012345678905&quot;,&#10;  &quot;observed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-01T03:12:07Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;advertised_price&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;129.99&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;json-ld.price&quot; },&#10;  &quot;list_price&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;159.99&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;dom.strike&quot; },&#10;  &quot;coupon_value&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;15.00&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;dom.coupon&quot; },&#10;  &quot;availability&quot;: &quot;https://schema.org/InStock&quot;,&#10;  &quot;variant_of&quot;: &quot;B0YYYYYYYY&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"listing_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B0XXXXXXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"gtin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0012345678905\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"observed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-01T03:12:07Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"advertised_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"129.99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"json-ld.price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"list_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"159.99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dom.strike\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"coupon_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"15.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dom.coupon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"availability\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://schema.org/InStock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"variant_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B0YYYYYYYY\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>货币、税与单位是三个独立陷阱。</strong> 多区域采集必须带上 <code>priceCurrency</code>（ISO 4217）与采集时刻的汇率快照，否则把 EUR 当成 USD 会把 130 欧元记成 130 美元，凭空造出一条违规。含税口径同样要标：欧盟站点页面价通常含 VAT，美国站点通常不含销售税，直接比较会系统性偏移。<strong>单位价格</strong>应在多件装、捆绑装、不同规格变体之间归一化——归一到「每件/每毫升/每克的广告价」再进入判定。</p>\n<p><strong>证据留存是这一层最容易被砍掉、却最不能砍的功能。</strong> 一条告警要能升级为平台举报甚至法律程序，必须能证明「在那一刻，页面上确实是这样」。可行做法是每次采集留存 HTML 原文（WARC 或压缩归档）+ 渲染截图 + 采集元数据（URL、时间戳、UA、出口 IP），并对三者计算哈希写入不可抵赖的日志。仅存解析后的数字，等于把证据链的锚点交给对方质疑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化与匹配-sku-身份与卖家归属\">归一化与匹配：SKU 身份与卖家归属</h2><p>解析出的价格只是一堆 <code>(url, price)</code>，没有身份就没有意义。<strong>实体解析</strong>要回答两个正交问题：这是<strong>哪件商品</strong>，以及这是<strong>哪个卖家</strong>。</p>\n<p>商品身份走的是一条从确定到模糊的阶梯：GTIN/UPC/EAN 精确匹配（最强，跨平台稳定）→ 平台内 ASIN / listing ID 映射（同平台强，跨平台断裂）→ 品牌型号 + 关键词模糊匹配 → 图片感知哈希（pHash）辅助。图片哈希有独特价值：窜货 listing 常直接盗用官方主图，pHash 能在标题被改得面目全非时把商品认出来。模糊匹配的产出<strong>必须进入人工复核队列</strong>，绝不能自动上报违规——误判一个授权卖家，代价远大于多复核一条。</p>\n<p>卖家归属是 MAP 监测区别于比价的分水岭：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归属判断</th>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>处置含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>授权经销商（白名单）</td>\n<td>卖家 ID / 名称命中授权名单</td>\n<td>走经销商合规流程，轻处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未授权但疑似正品</td>\n<td>低于地板价的稳定价、有品牌图、无授权记录</td>\n<td>窜货嫌疑，走溯源与供货排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疑似假货/灰产</td>\n<td>盗图、异常低价、新注册店铺</td>\n<td>升级平台举报 + 品牌保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报（同款第三方配件）</td>\n<td>品牌型号不同、兼容件</td>\n<td>加入排除名单，抑制重复告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>系统应维护<strong>白名单 + 排除名单</strong>双表：白名单把授权卖家与品牌自营排除在硬违规之外，排除名单吸收「同名不同物」的误报。两表都要有变更审计——白名单被悄悄放宽，等于把监测系统关掉。</p>\n<p>价格进入<strong>时序库</strong>后价值才释放：单点价格只能判断「现在是否违规」，而时序能识别「闪降」——某卖家在促销窗口内短暂击穿地板，日级快照恰好错过。时序应保留原始观测值并支持按 <code>(gtin, seller, marketplace)</code> 回放任意窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"违规判定引擎与告警闭环\">违规判定引擎与告警闭环</h2><p>判定的核心是一个规则引擎，最基础的比较是偏离度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>deviation</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>observed</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>MAP</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>MAP</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{deviation} = \\frac{p*{\\text{observed}} - p*{\\text{MAP}} \\cdot (1 + \\tau)}{p\\_{\\text{MAP}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deviation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.423em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAP</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">observed</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAP</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是缓冲带（容忍税差、汇率浮动、四舍五入），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>deviation</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{deviation} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deviation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 才进入告警候选。但<strong>单次采样就告警是误报的主要来源</strong>——页面可能正在 A/B、可能读到残影、可能是汇率抖动。因此引擎要有一层<strong>去抖</strong>：同一 listing 需连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次采样或持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 小时低于地板，才升级为真实告警。这本质是拿检测延迟换误报率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>detectDelay</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>falsePositive</mtext><mo>↓</mo><mtext> as </mtext><mi>N</mi><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{detectDelay} \\approx N \\cdot \\Delta t, \\qquad \\text{falsePositive} \\downarrow \\text{ as } N \\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">detectDelay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">falsePositive</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> as </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>判定必须消化 MAP 政策本身的例外</strong>，否则系统会与自家规则打架：MAP holiday、清仓/停产豁免、批发与 B2B 渠道、明确排除的品类。这些豁免是可配置的规则项，不是硬编码分支——政策每次调整都改代码，是这类系统最常见的运维灾难。</p>\n<p>告警要分级而非单档。一条可行阶梯：<strong>L1 内部记录</strong>（首次、幅度小）→ <strong>L2 通知经销商</strong>（合规函，限期整改）→ <strong>L3 平台举报</strong>（要求下架或移除低价）→ <strong>L4 法务/品牌保护</strong>（惯犯、疑似假货），每级绑定 SLA 与超时升级。判定之后必须有<strong>验证闭环</strong>：整改后复采该 listing，确认真实恢复才关单；只看「已通知」就关单，会让违规悄悄复发。</p>\n<p>衡量系统健康度靠四个指标：<strong>检测延迟</strong>（违规发生到告警）、<strong>误报率</strong>、<strong>恢复率</strong>（告警后真实回到地板之上）、<strong>覆盖率</strong>（目标宇宙中被实际采到的比例）。四者相互拉扯——把频率拉满能压低检测延迟，但成本、封禁风险与误报会一起上升。监测架构的决策，本质上是在这四条曲线之间选一个可运营的平衡点，而非追求任何单项最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价格监测与比价爬虫的分水岭是<strong>归属与举证</strong>：必须知道谁在卖、是否授权、证据能否质证。</li>\n<li>采集起点是<strong>目标宇宙</strong>（GTIN→listing 映射表），漏掉的目标无法靠后段精确度补回。</li>\n<li>抓取频率由<strong>风险评分</strong>驱动，<code>priority</code> 综合历史违规、波动率、流量与新 listing。</li>\n<li>合规红线：robots.txt 遵循 RFC 9309（≥500 KiB 解析能力），<code>Crawl-delay</code> 非标准且解释因爬虫而异；2025 年新增 <code>Content-Signal</code> 与 RSL 授权信号需纳入前置判断。</li>\n<li>解析优先 JSON-LD 的 schema.org <code>Offer</code>（<code>price</code> / <code>priceCurrency</code> / <code>priceValidUntil</code> / <code>priceSpecification</code> / <code>availability</code>），DOM 只作兜底。</li>\n<li>必须显式区分<strong>广告价与到手价</strong>、记录采集时刻汇率与含税口径、并做单位价格归一化。</li>\n<li>判定要<strong>去抖</strong>（连续 N 次/持续 M 小时）并消化 MAP 豁免，否则误报与自家规则打架；证据留存（HTML + 截图 + 哈希）是升级为举报的前提。</li>\n<li>成熟架构是分层混合，健康度看检测延迟、误报率、恢复率、覆盖率四个拉力指标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构","id":"全渠道价格采集与监测系统架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采集层：从目标宇宙到分布式抓取","id":"采集层-从目标宇宙到分布式抓取"},{"level":2,"text":"解析层：从页面到规范化价格记录","id":"解析层-从页面到规范化价格记录"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化与匹配：SKU 身份与卖家归属","id":"归一化与匹配-sku-身份与卖家归属"},{"level":2,"text":"违规判定引擎与告警闭环","id":"违规判定引擎与告警闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MAP 协议签署、违约认定与处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-policy-channel/map-agreement-breach-handling"},"next":{"title":"违规判定规则与证据固化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-monitoring-enforcement/violation-detection-evidence"}}